\id RUT  
\h Ruth 
\toc1 Ruth Lekhabu 
\toc2 Ruth 
\toc3 Ruth 
\mt1 RUTH  
\mt2 LEKHABU  
\mt3 Ruth Lekhabu Sung Thu Umdan  
\ip Ruth nikho lai chun thil thum nasatah in ana doudal in—Hiche phatlai miho chun numei le chapang ho ana jabol un, hinlah hitobang jabolna chu Ruth ana chang joupoi. Numei chu ajipa chunga kingai ahi in, hinlah Ruth meithai anahi e. Hiche Nam mite chu kinaicha jeng ahiuvin, hinlah Ruth gamdang mi ahi. Thusim’a kon mudoh chu Pakaijin gamdang nu hi akithopin chule gim le hesoh akon ahuhdoh ahi, ti akichen e. Hijeh chun Ruth Lekhabu nasim’a kon a hi kinepna namu tei ding ahi. Ajeh chu Pathen'in panpi ngaite apanpi, ti kicheh tah a na hetdoh thei ding ahi.  
\ip Ruth lekhabu hi ngailutna thusim jeng ahin, khatvei nasim’a kon nasim nom jing ding ahi. Ruth le Naomi hesoh akon ngailut nan alethuhna na mudoh ding, Pathen panpi a kon Ruth le Boaz kimuto chule ngailutna a adim lhon, hiche ngailutna chun Judah te le Gentile te kichen theina ahungsoh dohtan, Huhhingpu Jesu pen ding jong avetsah in ahi. Ruth lekhabu hi vaichatna akon haosatna, meithai a kon jinei theina, namdang akon Israel mi sona aphotchet ahi.  
\is1 Ruth Lekhabu Jihpa Chule Ajih Kum  
\ip Israel te pomdan in Samuel jih ahi akitin, hinlah koipen in ajih hetchet ahipoi. Chule hiche lekhabu hi Thutan Vaihom ho phat laiya kijih ahin, hichu 1375-1050 BC sung’a kijih ahi.  
\is1 Koi Henga Ajih Ham  
\ip Ruth lekhabu hi Israel mite dinga kijih ahi. Israel miten namdang ahinkhompi theina diuva kijih ahi. Ruth lekhabua hin Pathen thucheng seidoh ajaolou vang'in, Pathen natoh hi kicheh tah a mudoh ahi. Ajeh chu Ruth le Boaz kichenna hi kidangtah Pakai natoh ahin, hiche lungset thusim’a kon hin David chilhah te chule huhhingpu Jesu akon ngailutna avetsah in ahi.  
\c 1  
\s1 Elimelech Leh A Insung Miten Moab Gam Ajot U  
\p
\v 1 Israel te lah a thutan vaihom hon vai ahop laijun gamsung’a kel nasatah ahunglhung tan ahi. Hijeh chun Bethlehem a kon'in Juda mi khatnin ajinu leh acha teni akipuijin Moab gam’a cheng dingin achetan ahi.  
\v 2 Hiche pa min chu Elimelech ahin ajinu min chu Naomi ahi. Acha teni min chu Mahlon leh Chilion ahi. Amaho hi Judah gam Bethlehem’a konna Ephrath mi ahiuvin, Moab mite gam alhun phat un hichea chun acheng tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Hiche jou chun Elimelech chun, ajinu Naomi leh achapa teni chu dalhan ana thitan ahi.  
\v 4 Achapa teni chun Moab numei akichenpi lhon'in, khatnu min chu Orpah ahin chuleh khatnu chu Ruth ahi. Ahinlah kum som jou don’in,  
\v 5 Mahlon leh Chilion chu athi lhon tai. Naomi chu ajipa leh acha teni geijin adalha tauvin ahi.   
\s1 Naomi Le Ruth Bethlehem’a Ahung Kile  
\p
\v 6 Moab a aumna a konna chun Pathen'in Judah phatthei aboh in, chang leh mim asuh neng peh kittai tithu Naomi in ajatan ahi. Hijeh chun Naomi in amou teni kipui a Moab dalha a agamlam a kile kit dingin aki gotan ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Amou teni chutoh achennau gam'a konna kipatdoh a Judah gam lang jonkit dingin ahung kipatdoh tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Ahinlah lampi achun Naomi in amou teni kom'a hitin aseijin ahi, “Na inkote kom lang’a kile kit lhon tan naji teni ding leh keima dinga na phatna lhon jeh in Pakaijin phatthei naboh lhon hen!”  
\v 9 “Pakaijin lungmong in najinei sah lhon hen lang phatthei naboh lhon tahen” ati. Hichun kivailhah nan aki chopto uvin akika uvin achiplha tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Ahin amou teni chun adonbut in “Kanompoi, kilhon uhitin na mite kom lang’a keini jong kahung nom lhon e,” atilhon'in ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Ahinlah Naomi in adonbut nin, “Ibola keitoh iche khom diu ham?” Keiman nangni toh kicheng thei ding nao kanei kitthei beh ding ham?  
\v 12 Hithei ponte kamou teni, nanu napa lhon in'ah kile lhon tan, keima hi la jinei kit dingin kateh valtai. Tujan tah jeng jong hin jinei thei kit ding hileng chapa nei pai jeng thei ding hijong leng, chutileh ipi ham?  
\v 13 Midang toh kichen ding nom louvin hiche teni chu ahung let lhon na ngahdoh jou lhon nadem? Ahipoi, hithei mong-mong louding ahi, kamou teni! Nangni ding gelnan kei kalung akham lheh jenge, ajeh chu Pakai ama tah in nangni jeh a hi eijeplo ding ahi,” atipeh lhon tan ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Hichun avellin akikato kit tauve, hichun Orpah chun atehpi chu vailhahnan achop in adalha tai, ahin Ruth vang chun atehpi akolchah den tan ahi.  
\v 15 Naomi chun Ruth kom’ah, “Ven, na unu khu a pathen kom leh amite kom’ah akile kittai, nang jong hitia khu naum ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 16 Ahin Ruth in adonbutnin, “Nangma ka dalhah a kinungle dingin neijol jol tahih in, na chena channa kache ding, na chen chenna a kachen ding, namite chu kamite hi ding, na Pathen chu ka Pathen hi ding ahi.  
\v 17 Nathi thina a kathi ding, na kivuina mun a chu ka kivui ding ahi. Thinan eikhen lhon tilouva thil danga ka kikhenpi pou-pou leh Pakaijin ka chunga thu tan jeng hen!” ati.  
\v 18 Hichun Naomi in, Ruth chun kilhonpi tei ding lunggel dettah anei amudoh phat chun imacha asei tapoi.   
\p
\v 19 Hiti chun ani lhon'in akipat lhontai. Bethlehem alhun lhon phatnin, khopi miho chu akiling jeng tauvin ahi. Anumei te ho chu akihouvun, “Hiche khu Naomi hilou ham?” akitiuve.   
\p
\v 20 Amanun adonbutnin, “Naomi jong neiti tahih uvin, Marah joh neiti jouvin, ajeh chu Hatchungnung Pathen'in ka hinkho hi khaleuva eikoi ahitai,” ati.  
\v 21 “Keima bulhingset a potdoh kahin, ahinlah Pakaijin ahom keovin eihin lepui kittai. Pakaijin hichan geiya eibolgimta a nang hon Naomi neiti nahlai diu ham? Chuleh Hatchungnung Pathen'in hichan geija hi hamsetna eilhut khum hitalou ham?” ati.   
\p
\v 22 Hiti chun Naomi chu Moab gam'a kon'in amounu Moab numei khangthah cha chutoh ahung kile lhon tai. Amani Bethlehem ahung lhun lhon hin sakolchang at akipantai.   
\c 2  
\s1 Ruth In Boaz Louva Na Atoh  
\p
\v 1 Tun hiche Bethlehem ahin mihaotah leh mithunei tah khat amin Boaz kitipa chu ana umin ama chu Naomi jipa Elimelech sopi anahi.   
\p
\v 2 Nikhat hi Moab numeinu Ruth chun Naomi kom'ah, “Keima hi nei sollin lang chang-at ho lah a che ing kating, koi hijongleh khotona einei pou-pou kom’ah changkhai gahol tange,” ati.  
\p Hichun Naomi chun ajah a “Chanu, che jengin,” ati. \x + \xo 2:2 \xt Thempu Dan 19:9,10; Danbu Ni Na 24:19\x*  
\v 3 Hiti chun Ruth chu akipatdoh in chang-at ho nung langa chun achen, changkhai ho chu achom pan tan ahi. Hitia changkhai achomna loulai chu atehpu Elimelech sopipa Boaz loulai ana hikha in ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Hitia changkhai ana kichom lai pettah chun Boaz chu Bethlehem’a kon'in ahungin “Pakaijin na umpiu hen,” atin, ama hon jong “Pakaijin phatthei naboh hen” atiuve.   
\p
\v 5 Hichun aman tohvaihompa kom’ah chun, “Hichea numei khangdong nu khu koiham? Koiya kon ham?” tin adong'e.   
\p
\v 6 Tohvaihompan ahin donbutnin, “Amanu khu Moab numei Naomi toh hung kinungle khom numei chu ahi.  
\v 7 “Amanu hin tujingkah chun chang-at ho nung langa akhaiho hi kaki donkhom thei ding ham tin eina dongin ahi. Chomkhat cha jong touthim man louvin anatoh ding toh nan akisalel lheh jeng e,” tin adonbut in ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Hichun Boaz chu Ruth kom'a chun achen ajah a, “Ngaijin ka chanu, changkhai nakihol sung hin keiho kom’ah um jengin, koima dang louva che hih in, kalouva natong numeiho nunga hin um jengin.  
\v 9 Achang atna mun u melchih inlang chule anung’u jui jengin, gollhang ho hin nadai chatvai louna diuva keiman kagihsal ahitai. Nadang achah teng twikul'a konna aga dop u twi khu don jengin,” atipeh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Ruth chu akengphang’a abohkhup jengin hiti hin kipathu aseije, “Keima hila gam chommi kahin, i-atileh hibang lom'a hi nei khoto hitam?” ati.   
\p
\v 11 Boaz in adobutnin, “Ken nangma kahenai,” ati, “chujongleh najipa athijou nung’a nangin ichan geiya natehpi khohsahna neitah a nahin jen hitam, chujongleh ichan geija nagam leiset nanu leh napa nahin dalhah a gam chombeh miho lah a hi nahung chenkhompi jeng ham tijong kahei.  
\v 12 Alhaving noija nahung kipehlutna Pakai, Israel Pathen chun na thilpha bol ho jeh hin phattheina lhingset in nape tahen,” ati.   
\p
\v 13 Ruth in adonbut in, “Pu, kachunga nalung lhaina umjing tahen, na natongho lah a khat jeng jong kahilou vang'in nangin khotona neitah in thu naseijin nei lhamon’e,” ati.   
\p
\v 14 Sun-an nehphat in Boaz in amanu chu akouvin, “Hilanga hungin lang bu hung nen, na changlhah chu lengpi thei twi lah ahin sulut inlang nen,” ati. Hiti chun Ruth chu chang at holah a chun atouvin ahileh, Boaz in aneh ding changlhah apen, aman jong a oivaset anen, aneh moh themkhat jong anei nalaijin ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Ruth chu natonga akilekit phatnin, Boaz in agollhang ho chu thu apen, “Amanu hi jada hih un, nalah uva changvui chu kilo khomsah un,” ati.  
\v 16 “Sakol changvui ho chu alomlah a kon’in ladoh unlang amanun akilo ding gunset in selhah peh jengun, hichu kilhen sah unlang sugenthei hih un!” ati.   
\p
\v 17 Hiti chun Ruth in nilhum keijin chang chu akidon khomin achangho chu ajeplhah phatnin abeng chu adimset tai.  
\v 18 Amanun hichu khopi sunga atehpi kom’ah apolut in avetsah in achanglhah nehmoh akhenpeh jong chu apetan ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Naomi’in, “Chang hijatpi hi hoilanga nagalo khom ham? Pakaijin nahin kithopi pa hi phatthei boh hen!” ati.  
\p Hichun Ruth in atehpi kom’ah chun changkhai aga kidonna louneipa thu chu aseipeh tan ahi. “Tuni kagatohna louneipa chu Boaz ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 20 “Ama chu Pathen’in phatthei boh hen!” atin, Naomi’n amounu jah a chun hitin aseipeh tai “Aman hitobang khotona anei hi eini chung’a ahin, chule najipa chung’a ahi. Amapa hi i-insung’u kiledohsah thei ikinaipi pen khat u chu ahi,” ati. \x + \xo 2:20 \xt Thempu Dan 25:25\x*   
\p
\v 21 Ruth’in aseibe in, “Boaz in hungkit inlang chang-at hi akichai kahsen, changvo ho lah a hi kaum khom jingna diuvin eiseipeh in ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 22 Naomi’n, “Aphai, ka chanu aman naseipeh bang-bang hin chonin, hiche chang-at hi akichai kahsen a nungah ho lah a chun um'in, loumun danga che hih in, min nadai chatvai thei ahin ama louva vang hi imacha tilou ding ahi,” atipeh e.   
\p
\v 23 Hiti chun Ruth jong Boaz loulai achun sakol chang-at kichai kahse chun anumei hou toh atongkhom’in, changkhai chu akilokhom’in ahi. Chuleh sakol chang leh suhlou chang-at kichai kahsen changkhai akichom tai, hiche sungse hin ama atehpi toh aum khom jing jengin ahi.   
\c 3  
\s1 Changphol'a Ruth Le Boaz  
\p
\v 1 Hiti chun nikhat Naomi in Ruth kom’a chun, “Ka chanu keiman na inchen theina ding ngaito peh leng hichu nang dinga pha ding ahi.  
\v 2 Boaz hi eini dinga ikinaipi pen i-inko’u khat ahi, chule khotona neitah anungah goiho toh natoh khomsah jing ahi. Tujan’a hi aman achangphol’a sakol chang aden ahi.  
\v 3 Hijeh chun kasei bang-bang hin bollin, “Kisil thengsel inlang thao kinunlang navon hoipen kivon inlang, achangvohna phol'a chun gachesuh in ahinla aneh a adonchai tokah in Boaz chu kimusah hih in.  
\v 4 Alup tengleh alupna mun chu melchih in, chuteng chenlang akengphang chu hohdoh inlang hilai mun’ah chun lum in. Hiteng chuleh aman nabol ding nahin seipeh tante,” ati.   
\p
\v 5 Ruth in adonbut in, “Bollin nati tichu kabol jeng ding ahi,” ati.  
\v 6 Hiche jan chun amanu jong achesuh in atehpi’n bol ding’a aseipeh jouse chu abol tan ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Boaz chun aneh a adon jouva chuleh lung kipah tah a aum jouvin Boaz chu achang kiset vumna pang’a chun agalum tan ahi. Hichun Ruth jong kangchan aga vahlut in, akengphang teni ahohdoh in alumtai.  
\v 8 Jan khangkim donin Boaz chu ahung kin khang in, agah kihei leh akengphang kom’a numei khat analup chu amudoh tan ahi.  
\v 9 Hichun aman jong “Koi nahim?” tia adohleh, numeinu chun ahin donbut in  
\p “Keima nasohnu Ruth kahi, napon chu keijong neihin silpeh in ajeh chu nangma hi insungmi kinaipi pen chu nahi,” ati.  
\v 10 Hichun Boaz injong aseijin, “Ka chanu Pakaijin phatthei naboh hen, nangman natoh masat thilpha sanga jong tua hi aphacheh nabol kit ahitai, hao hen vai jongleh gollhang ho joh hol louva umah nahi.  
\v 11 Chuti ahile, tun ka chanu lungkham hih in keiman bol dinga lom ho chu hinbol nange, ajeh chu hiche khopi sunga mijouse hin nangma hi numei phachom tah nahi ahet sohkeiyu ahi.  
\v 12 Keima hi na kinaipi insungmi chu kahinai ahinla kei sanga na kinaipi khat aum nalai in ahi. \x + \xo 3:12 \xt Ruth 2:20\x*  
\v 13 Tujan geh khovah den inlang, jingkah teng ama chun phung kinaipi toh dingdol kin na bolpeh leh apha ahi jenge, ahinlah aman hichu abolnom louva ahileh hingjing Pakai minna kasei ahi, keiman na bolpeh nang'e, tun jingkah geijin umtan,” ati.   
\p
\v 14 Hiti chun Ruth jong Boaz kengphang bulla chun jingkah geijin alum’in, ahin jingkah lang kungbul le mi kimah donin athoudoh in Boaz in, “Hiche changvohna phol'a hin numei aum'e ti koima chan hetda hen,” ati  
\v 15 Hiche jou chun Boaz in amanu kom'a chun, “Napon chu hin phan” atin sakol chang chu atena dim gup jen asempeh in akiputsah tai, hiti chun khopi sung lang’a chun achetan ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Ruth chu atehpi kom alhun phat in Naomi’n, “Ipi toh nagabah hinam?” atileh,  
\p Ruth chun Naomi chu Boaz in abolpeh jouse chu aseipeh tan ahi.  
\v 17 Chuleh Ruth chun aseijin, “Natehpi kom'a sagoh keuva nakinung le louding ahi tin sakol chang atena dimgup eihin pohsah e,” ati.   
\p
\v 18 Hichun Naomi’n amanu kom'ah, “Ka chanu, itobang thil hung sohdoh mong-mong am ti ijah kahsen ngah hat in, amapa chun tunia hi thil khat atohlhah tokah a umthim louhel ding ahi,” ati.   
\c 4  
\s1 Boaz In Ruth Akichenpi  
\p
\v 1 Boaz chu khopi kelkot phunga ache touvin hikom'a chun agatou tai. Hiche pettah chun insung kinaipipen atipa chu ahungin ahileh Boaz chun akouvin, “Golpa, hungin lang hichea hin tou tadin kasei nomkhat aum'e,” atin ahi. Hichun amani chu atoukhom lhon tan ahi.  
\v 2 Chuin Boaz in khopi sunga lamkai som akou khom'in athu hetoh dingin atousah in ahi.  
\v 3 Hichun Boaz in insung kinaipi pen kom'a chun hiti hin aseitan ahi. “Moab gam'a konna hung kile kit Naomi chu nahen ahi. Ama hin ikinaipi Elimelech gam chu ajoh in ahi.  
\v 4 Keiman nakom'a ka seinom chu ahileh hiche hi na lhatnom leh kilhatnin kati ahi. Agam chu nadei leh hiche ahetoh mi hijat masanga hin kichoh jengin, ahinlah nangin nadei louva ahileh tutun nei hetsah jengin ajeh chu nang banna alhat thei akinaipi chu kei kahi,” ati.  
\p Hichun mipa chun “Aphai, keiman kilhat nang'e,” tin adonbut in ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Hijou chun Boaz in ama kom'a chun hintin aseije; “Aphai, Naomi gam chu nachoh dinga ahileh Moab meithai nu Ruth jong hi na kichenpi ding ahi, hitia chu amanun cha anei teng ajipa min chu aput ding insungmi hina a agam chu nanga hi ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 6 Akinaipi penpa chun ahin donbut in hitin aseipeh tai, “Chuti ding ahileh keiman lhat jou ponge, ajeh chu hichun keima gam eisuhboi peh ding ahi, hijeh chun nangin kilhat tan,” ati tai.   
\p
\v 7 Tun hiche lai khanga chun Isreal te lah a chun chena dan khat ana um'in mikhat touvin thil achohna ding athaneina chu mikhat kom'a apehdoh a ahileh akengkoh chu asutna ama pa chu apeh ding ahi. Hitia chu mipi hetna kikhut lhehna chu kisudetji ahi. \x + \xo 4:7 \xt Danbu Ni Na 25:9\x*  
\v 8 Hiti chun a insung kinaipipen pa chun akengkoh chu asutlhan Boaz kom'a chun aseitai, “Nangin kilhat tan,” ati.   
\p
\v 9 Hichun Boaz in upaho leh avel'a ding mipi ho jah a chun “Tunia hi keiman Naomi khutna kon'in Elimelech, Chilion le Mahlon nei jouse aboncha kachoh ahitai.  
\v 10 Chujongleh gam jouse puma hi Moab numei Ruth kitinu Mahlon meithainu jong hi kaji dinga kachan tha ahitai. Hitia chu amanun cha pasal ahin'a, athisa ajipa insung min hi atundoh a, hiche achennau khopi sunga hi a insung thil le lo jouse jong hi agouva kisim ding ahi. Nangho jouse hi tunia ahetoh nahi tauve,” ati. \x + \xo 4:10 \xt Danbu Ni Na 25:5,6\x*   
\p
\v 11 Hichun upaho leh mipi kelkotna ding ho jouse chun ahin donbut uvin, “Keiho ahetoh kahiuve, Pakaijin hiche numei na insung’a ahunglut hi Isreal nam hung kondohna Rachel leh Leah toh bahsah hen! Nang jong Ephrathah bangin pungin lang Bethlehem a minthang tahen.” atiuvin ahi. \x + \xo 4:11 \xt Semtilbu 29:31\x*  
\v 12 “Chuleh Pakaijin hiche khangdong numeinu a kon hin i-puluiyu Judah leh Tamar chapa Perez tobangin chilhah tamtah nape hen!” atiuve. \x + \xo 4:12 \xt Semtilbu 38:27-30\x*   
\s1 Boaz Chilhah Ho  
\p
\v 13 Hichun Boaz in Ruth chu a in'ah akipuilut in hiti chun amanu chu amapa jinu ahung hitai. Aman amanu chu aluppin ahileh Pakaijin nao ahin vopsah in, amanun chapa khat ahin hingtai.  
\v 14 Hichun khopi sunga numeiho chun Naomi kom'ah “Na insung’a gam ngah ding nahin tundoh peh a Pakai chu thangvah in umhen! Hiche chapang hi Isreal nam sung’ah hung minthang hen.  
\v 15 Ama hin na khangdong sah kit henlang chuleh nateh lang hinkho hi nahin vetsui peh tahen. Ajeh chu ama hi nahin ngailua na mounu cha ahin chapa sagi nanei sanga phajo ahi,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 16 Hichun Naomi chun hiche naosen chu akipom in a-optoh asipbeh tan ahi. Aman ama cha mong-mong bangin akidon tan ahi.  
\v 17 A inheng numei hon, tun Naomi’n cha aneikit tai. Chuleh ama hon amin chu Obed asah tauve. Ama hi Jesse pa ahung hin David pu ahung hitai.   
\p
\v 18 Hiche hi apuluiyu Perez son achilhah ho chu ahung hitauve:  
\b  
\li1 Perez hi Hezron pa ahung hi.   
\li1
\v 19 Hezron hi Ram pa ahi.  
\li1 Ram hi Amminadab pa ahi.   
\li1
\v 20 Amminadab chu Nahshon pa ahi.  
\li1 Nahshon hi Salmon pa ahi.   
\li1
\v 21 Salmon hi Boaz pa ahi.  
\li1 Boaz hi Obed pa ahi.   
\li1
\v 22 Obed hi Jesse pa ahi.  
\li1 chuleh Jesse hi David pa ahi.   